    "body": "I do think it would be good to revisit support for HTTP trailers in responses and requests in general, particularly in light of things like https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/new-additional-checksum-algorithms-for-amazon-s3/ which make direct use of trailers in both directions.",
