    "updated_at": "2022-03-02T07:37:11Z",
    "body": "Reading @davidben's reply [there](https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/34#issuecomment-119718917), I agree that Server-Timing exposure falls into the \"I understand what this would mean\" bucket. At the same time, the implementation complexity arguments (e.g. requiring trailer support implementation in the HTTP cache) still stand AFAIK.",
