    "created_at": "2022-03-02T22:25:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-02T22:25:47Z",
    "body": "@yoavweiss:\r\n> does your use case require Server-Timing trailer support, or trailers in general?\r\n\r\nTrailers in general... but don't take it as a We Must Have It type of thing. We are looking at whether or not we could ever support that new AWS spec without resorting to non-standard extensions and it's looking most likely that we won't.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
