    "body": "> Caches are [allowed to drop trailers](https://httpwg.org/http-core/draft-ietf-httpbis-cache-latest.html#storing.fields).\r\n\r\n@mnot - while true, if we were to expose Server-Timing in trailers, whether caches drop them or not would be extremely web visible..",
